<title>UK: Only set of Brent dates kept by trader.</title>
<headline>Only set of Brent dates kept by trader.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The only set of Brent dates was kept by traders Phibro and later sold on, traders said.</p>
<p>The Dec 26-28 cargo was sold to another trading house at January Brent +33 cts.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
